              "description": "<p>Update for SPT 3.5.5</p>\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong> Will <strong>NOT</strong> work with any prior version of SPT, use the old version of the plugin for old versions of SPT</p>\n",
              "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/824/task-list-fixes/1.0.1",
