            },
            {
              "id": 7360,
              "hub_id": 5835,
              "version": "1.0.0",
              "description": "<p>Implemented the last couple features I wanted before I considered this a “full release”.</p>\n<p>This version brings a few more quality-of-life improvements, all of which can be toggled off in the F12 menu:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add a new feature that defaults the sort order of columns to a more sane value when changing between columns\n<ul>\n<li>Task, Trader and Location will now default to sorting in ascending order</li>\n<li>Progress and Status will now default to sorting in descending order</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Improved sorting order to include sub-sorting, to make finding quests in your list a lot easier\n<ul>\n<li>Sorting by trader now sub-sorts by location, then name</li>\n<li>Sorting by location now sub-sorts by trader, then name</li>\n<li>Sorting by type now sub-sorts by name</li>\n<li>Sorting by status now sub-sorts by name</li>\n<li>Sorting by progress now sub-sorts by name</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you prefer the existing behaviour of v0.0.1, you can disable these new settings in the F12 menu.</p>\n<p>A build for 3.5.0 is available on GitHub: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/DrakiaXYZ/SPT-TaskListFixes/releases/download/1.0.0/DrakiaXYZ-TaskListFixes-1.0.0-.3.5.0.zip\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/DrakiaXYZ/SPT-TaskListFixes/releases/download/1.0.0/DrakiaXYZ-TaskListFixes-1.0.0-.3.5.0.zip</a></p>\n",
              "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/824/task-list-fixes/1.0.0",
